  "attribution": "Human Base Meshes v1.4.1, Blender Studio and community contributors; GEO-body_male_realistic, existing project mannequin derivative.",
  "method": "Offline Three.js photography of the existing mature mesh with the existing titanium shader and region definitions. Portrait framing contains the complete head, upper groups through mid-thigh and lower groups through the feet; transparent 1024px render is downsampled and trimmed to its visible bounds with a small safety margin. Photography alone adds physical studio reflections and fine roughness brushing to the titanium body; source-colour regions have a less metallic enamel finish.",
  "limits": "Colours show functional teaching locations. Deep structures use the existing hatched proxy. These are not independent internal muscle geometry, EMG, or exact anatomy/Snow registration.",
